<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34906" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναπο-θνῄσκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>die in</i> a place, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ νήσῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.104
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.65
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάροις</span>] <i>among</i> the gulls, <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.Com.
				69
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				182.20
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gortyn</span>); <i>die in</i> or
				<i>during</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναποθανεῖν ἐν τοῖς καλλίστοις ἔργοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.41.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ὑπεροχαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					15.35.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο εἴ τις φάγοι, ἐ</span>.
			if he were to eat, he <i>dies of it</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.4.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. βασάνοις</span>
			<i>die under</i> torture, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.596f
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτυχίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.192
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον ἐ. ἐπιτήδειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					2.35
				</span></i>
			.</div>
